# AI-Ready pilot (stage 1) settings. Copy to .env (`make run-pilot` does this once) and review.
# Secrets (signing keys, API keys) are NOT kept here: they are files under ./secrets, created by init-secrets.sh
# and mounted at /run/secrets/<name>. Only infrastructure passwords for the bundled containers live here.

# --- image -----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AIREADY_IMAGE=aiready/aiready
AIREADY_VERSION=dev
AIREADY_ENV=pilot
AIREADY_LOG_LEVEL=INFO
# Interface that published ports bind to. Keep 127.0.0.1 unless a reverse proxy/TLS sits in front.
AIREADY_BIND=127.0.0.1

# --- data zone ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Change both before first start; they are baked into the volumes on creation.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=change-me-postgres
REDIS_PASSWORD=change-me-redis
QDRANT_API_KEY=

# --- model zone (profile "gpu") ------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Weights are pre-staged here (the model zone has no outbound network). Layout: <dir>/{chat,embed,rerank}/
MODEL_STORE_DIR=./models
CHAT_MODEL_DIR=chat
CHAT_MODEL_NAME=chat
CHAT_MAX_MODEL_LEN=8192
CHAT_GPU_MEMORY_UTILIZATION=0.85
EMBED_MODEL_DIR=embed
RERANK_MODEL_DIR=rerank
# GPU indices: one GPU node may hold the chat model on GPU 0 and the shared embedding/rerank on GPU 1.
CHAT_GPU_DEVICE=0
SHARED_GPU_DEVICE=0

# Model endpoints seen by the platform (OpenAI-compatible). Defaults point at the mock server;
# `make run-pilot-gpu` overrides them. A private endpoint (stage 1 option) can be set here instead.
# AIREADY_MODEL_CHAT_URL=http://vllm-chat:8000/v1
# AIREADY_MODEL_SMALL_URL=http://vllm-chat:8000/v1
# AIREADY_MODEL_EMBED_URL=http://tei-embed:80
# AIREADY_MODEL_RERANK_URL=http://tei-rerank:80

# --- integration -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base URL of the existing application the API facade wraps (the demo profile runs a sample one).
LEGACY_APP_URL=http://legacy-app:8000

# --- pinned third-party images (override to use an internal registry) ----------------------------------
# POSTGRES_IMAGE=pgvector/pgvector:pg16
# REDIS_IMAGE=redis:7.4-alpine
# QDRANT_IMAGE=qdrant/qdrant:v1.12.4
# VLLM_IMAGE=vllm/vllm-openai:v0.6.4
# TEI_IMAGE=ghcr.io/huggingface/text-embeddings-inference:1.5
# OTEL_IMAGE=otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib:0.111.0
# PROMETHEUS_IMAGE=prom/prometheus:v2.55.0
# TEMPO_IMAGE=grafana/tempo:2.6.1
# LOKI_IMAGE=grafana/loki:3.2.1
# GRAFANA_IMAGE=grafana/grafana:11.3.0
# SQUID_IMAGE=ubuntu/squid:6.6-24.04_edge
